<title>USA: Raymond James lifts annual div to $0.44/shr.</title>
<headline>Raymond James lifts annual div to $0.44/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James Financial Inc on Friday said it will increase the annual dividend rate on its common shares to $0.44 per share from $0.38.</p>
<p>The first $0.11 per share quarterly dividend will be payable on January 3, 1997, to shareholders of record on December 13, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
